{{For|the Scary Jerry on {{Gamemode|Stranded}}|Scary Jerry (Stranded)}}
'''Scary Jerry''' is a [[Spooky Mob]] that spawns in [[Wilderness]] and [[Graveyard]] during a [[Spooky Festival]], or from [[Trick or Treat Chest]]s. It is similar to the other Spooky Mobs, where it only takes {{Stat|Damage|1}} each hit. If it is attacked with a [[Ghoul Buster]], it takes {{Stat|Damage|2}} per hit.

== Spawning ==
The Scary Jerry can naturally spawn in the {{Zone|Graveyard}} and {{Zone|Wilderness}} at night while a [[Spooky Festival]] is active. It can also be spawned from {{Mctxt|c|TRICK}} [[Trick or Treat Chest]]s. It has a {{Green|3.06122449%}} chance to be the Mob spawned by the Trick or Treat Chest.

